:{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1014105","helmet":"WP1024205"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11215","name":{"zh":"威震华夏","en":"Might Resounds Across China"},"year":"219","month":"7"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1001","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[25,15,71,79,74,80],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1014105","helmet":"WP1024205"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10702","name":{"zh":"夷陵之战","en":"Battle of Yiling"},"year":"221","month":"5"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1001","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[25,15,71,79,74,80],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1014105","helmet":"WP1024205"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10115","name":{"zh":"征讨南蛮","en":"Southern Campaign"},"year":"225","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1001","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[25,15,71,79,74,80],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1014105","helmet":"WP1024205"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10915","name":{"zh":"北伐中原","en":"Northern Expedition"},"year":"227","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1001","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[25,15,71,79,74,80],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1014105","helmet":"WP1024205"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11015","name":{"zh":"再出岐山","en":"Return to Qishan"},"year":"231","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1001","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[25,15,71,79,74,80],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1014105","helmet":"WP1024205"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1001","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[25,15,71,79,74,80],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1014105","helmet":"WP1024205"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1001","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[25,15,71,79,74,80],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1014105","helmet":"WP1024205"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1005","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[25,15,71,79,74,80],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"5300","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1014105","helmet":"WP1024205"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10058","city":"CS1001","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[25,15,71,79,74,80],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"5300","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1014105","helmet":"WP1024205"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"仕于刘表手下的谋士，朝廷中郎将。袁绍、曹操皆派使者前去笼络刘表时提议投靠曹操，便被刘表遣至许昌探查，但韩嵩示意若天子赐职务，便不再为刘表所用。后官至侍中，零陵太守。返回荆州后因被刘表怀疑而进牢。刘琮投降曹操后，曹操进军荆州，被释放后官至大鸿胪。","tc":"仕于劉表手下的謀士，朝廷中郎將。袁紹、曹操皆派使者前去籠絡劉表時提議投靠曹操，便被劉表遣至許昌探查，但韓嵩示意若天子賜職務，便不再為劉表所用。后官至侍中，零陵太守。返回荊州后因被劉表懷疑而進牢。劉琮投降曹操后，曹操進軍荊州，被釋放后官至大鴻臚。","en":"An advisor under Liu Biao and an imperial General of the Household. When both Yuan Shao and Cao Cao sent envoys to win over Liu Biao, Han Song proposed supporting Cao Cao and was sent to Xuchang to investigate. However, Han Song indicated that if the Emperor granted him an official position, he would no longer serve Liu Biao. He later rose to Commandant and Governor of Lingling. Upon returning to Jing Province, he was imprisoned by Liu Biao on suspicion of disloyalty. After Liu Cong surrendered to Cao Cao and Cao Cao advanced into Jing Province, Han Song was released and rose to Chief Administrator.","jp":"劉表配下の謀士で、朝廷の中郎将。袁紹と曹操がともに使者を送って劉表を懐柔しようとした際、曹操への帰順を進言したため、劉表によって許昌へ情勢を探るべく派遣された。その際、韓嵩は天子から官職を賜ればもはや劉表には仕えられなくなるとあらかじめ伝えていた。許昌で侍中、零陵太守に任じられたが、荊州へ帰還後に劉表から疑われて投獄された。劉琮が曹操に降伏し、曹操が荊州に進軍すると釈放され、後に官位は大鴻臚にまで至った。","kr":"유표 휘하의 모사이자 조정의 중랑장. 원소와 조조가 모두 사신을 보내 유표를 회유하려 할 때 조조에게 귀부할 것을 진언하였고, 이에 유표에 의해 정세를 살피러 허창으로 파견되었다. 출발 전 한숭은 천자께서 관직을 내리신다면 더 이상 유표를 섬길 수 없게 될 것이라 미리 뜻을 내비쳤다. 이후 허창에서 시중과 영릉태수에 제수되었으나, 형주로 돌아온 뒤 유표의 의심을 받아 투옥되었다. 훗날 유종이 조조에게 항복하고 조조가 형주로 진군한 뒤 풀려나 관직이 대홍려에 이르렀다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10555","remark":"","surname":"韩","surnameTc":"韓","surnameEn":"Han","surnameJp":"韓","surnameKr":"한","surnameOther":"","name":"嵩","nameTc":"嵩","nameEn":"Song","nameJp":"嵩","nameKr":"숭","nameOther":"","word":"德高","wordTc":"德高","wordEn":"Degao","wordJp":"徳高","wordKr":"덕고","wordOther":"","icon":"韩嵩","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"184","city":"CS1005","gender":"0","rule":"25","force":"15","wise":"71","politics":"79","charm":"74","will":"80","ruleTalent":"1","forceTalent":"1","wiseTalent":"8","politicsTalent":"9","charmTalent":"6","willTalent":"9","weaponMaster":"5/5/5/5/5/73/24/5","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"1003105;1005805","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"600","battleSoulPoint":"200","debateSoulPoint":"5000","strategy":"1004108","strategy2":"1000305","professions":"0/0/0/0/1/0/0/3/1/3/0/0/0/0/0/1/3/2/0/1/0/0/0/1","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"4","compatible":"26","loyalty":"0","reputation":"5300","evaluate":"0","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"154","show":"184"